{"id":"fa5qknreyjxiy2i1iyw709g2l","title":"今日房贷利率7%为何感觉更贵","originalTitle":"Mortgage rates were 7% in 1997, too—here’s why buying a home feels more expensive today","summary":"今日30年固定房贷利率约为7.2%，与1997年的7.18%相近，但房价上涨远超收入增长，导致月供占收入比例从23%升至31%。即使利率相同，今日购买中位数房价的月供占收入的比例比1997年高出约18个百分点，增加了家庭负担。预计未来房贷利率短期内不会显著下降。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"CNBC Top News"},"links":{"original":"https://www.cnbc.com/make-it/2026/11/12/mortgage-rates-home-affordability-1997.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T15:00:01.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T16:31:33.966Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T16:31:33.966Z","category":"macro","tags":["数据发布","通胀","利率"],"score":45,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"rates","name":"利率与流动性"},{"slug":"inflation","name":"通胀与就业"},{"slug":"data","name":"数据发布"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}